{"id": "168", "name": "Calcium Carbonate + Vitamin D3 + Multimineral", "slug": "calcium-carbonate-vitamin-d3-multimineral-168", "monograph_link": "", "drug_class": "Specific mineral & vitamin combined preparations", "indication": "Vitamin deficiency", "indication_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\"><div class=\"min-str-block\"><div class=\"min-str mb-5\" style=\"display: none;\">This preparation is indicated in-<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Prevention and treatment of osteoporosis</li>\n<li>To maintain strong bone growth</li>\n<li>For proper functioning of heart, muscle and nerves</li>\n<li>As nutritional supplement</li>\n<li>For bone development and regeneration of bone</li>\n<li>Pregnancy &amp; lactation</li> <span class=\"min-str-toggle tx-green tx-bold\" style=\"cursor:pointer;font-style:italic;\">... Read more</span></ul></div><div class=\"full-str\">This preparation is indicated in-<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Prevention and treatment of osteoporosis</li>\n<li>To maintain strong bone growth</li>\n<li>For proper functioning of heart, muscle and nerves</li>\n<li>As nutritional supplement</li>\n<li>For bone development and regeneration of bone</li>\n<li>Pregnancy &amp; lactation</li>\n<li>Deficiency state of Calcium, Vitamin D3, Magnesium, Zinc, Copper, Manganese &amp; Boron</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>", "therapeutic_class_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Specific mineral &amp; vitamin combined preparations</div>", "pharmacology_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Nutrition is the most important to prevent osteoporosis and other bone related diseases. Calcium, Magnesium &amp; Vitamin D3 are the macronutrients for bone. Without Vitamin D3 very little Calcium is absorbed. Like Calcium, Magnesium increases bone strength and rigidity. Recent epidemiological studies showed that some micronutrients like Copper, Manganese, Zinc &amp; Boron play an important role in bone health. Deficiency of the micronutrients is noticed in patients with osteoporosis.</div>", "dosage_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">2 tablets per day, preferably 1 tablet in the morning and 1 tablet in the evening.</div>", "administration_description": "", "interaction_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">It has possible interaction with Calcium, Aluminium or Magnesium containing Antacids &amp; other Calcium supplements, Calcitriol &amp; other Vitamin D3 supplements; Digoxin, Tetracycline, Doxycycline, Minocycline or Oxytetracycline.</div>", "contraindications_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">It is contraindicated in case of hypercalcaemia, hyperthyroidism, renal calculi &amp; nephrolithiasis and Zollinger-Ellison Syndrome.</div>", "side_effects_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">It is generally well tolerated. If there is experience like nausea, vomiting, stomach cramps, dry mouth, increased thirst, increased urination while taking, noticed to physicians. Side effects from micronutrient are rare.</div>", "pregnancy_and_lactation_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">This combination should be used as directed by physician during pregnancy or while breast-feeding.</div>", "precautions_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">If there is any pre-existing heart disease or kidney disease, precautions should be taken.</div>", "pediatric_usage_description": "", "overdose_effects_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Symptoms of overdosage may include nausea and vomiting, severe drowsiness, dry mouth, loss of appetite, metallic taste, stomach cramps, diarrhea, headache &amp; constipation.</div>", "duration_of_treatment_description": "", "reconstitution_description": "", "storage_conditions_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Keep in a dry place away from light and heat. Keep out of the reach of children.</div>", "brands": [{"id": "14510", "name": "Apocal-DM", "slug": "apocal-dmtablet", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "", "manufacturer": "Apex Pharmaceuticals Ltd.", "price": "৳ 5.00", "package_container": "Unit Price: ৳ 5.00,(15's pack: ৳ 75.00),,Unit Price: ৳ 5.00,(30'